# Evidence never belongs in this repo. Receipts, qualification lanes, and audit
# output are written into whichever repo Legion is operated on; when that repo is
# Legion itself, they stay untracked here and are tracked by the consuming
# workspace outside this nested checkout. These trees were purged from history on
# 2026-08-19 — do not re-add them. Phase B's generated catalog projection is
# source-derived package data, not qualification evidence, so it stays tracked.
qualification/*
!qualification/generated-catalogs.json
# The bench is measurement INPUT, not evidence: fixtures with known answers,
# the detectors scored against them, and the harness. Ignoring the whole tree
# is why bench/corpora could never be committed while src/registry/coverage
# went on citing its digests. Run output stays ignored below.
bench/qualifications/
bench/**/*.receipt.json
_audit/
# Bare `_selfcheck/` also matched bench/_selfcheck/, the known-answer pair the
# shipped manual tells the reader to run against the runtime harness. Ignore
# only a self-check tree written into a repository being audited.
/_selfcheck/
evidence/
*.receipt.json
